.SH BUGS
The tabs are not drawn as tabs.
They are radiobuttons in a row, so they look like radiobuttons; making
them look like a notebook wants either a canvas or a themed-widget layer,
which is the expensive half.
.PP
No keyboard traversal between tabs beyond what focus already does, and no
way to add or remove one after
.BR new .
.PP
A label passed here is quoted with
.BR tk->quote .
Passing text with a leading
.B '
of your own will still be read to the end of the line, which is what that
character means in
.IR tk (2).
